<title>USA: BASEBALL-YANKEES WIN GAME 5 OF WORLD SERIES.</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-YANKEES WIN GAME 5 OF WORLD SERIES.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the fifth game of the</p>
<p>World Series on Thursday:</p>
<p> New York Yankees     1   ATLANTA BRAVES     0</p>
<p>(New York leads best-of-seven series 3-2)</p>
</text>
